        "A warehouse photograph is useful only when the question is precise. Before opening the gallery, write the claim you need to test: the received item appears to be the selected color, the size label is present, two pieces are visible, or a surface mark appears near a seam. This prevents a general feeling about quality from replacing an observable test. OOPBuy’s current inspection information describes checks of quantity, color, size, specifications and visible appearance damage. Those categories define a practical starting point, not a promise that every hidden or technical property has been tested.",
